  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Identification and formulation of Danish contribution to theTeam Europe Initiative on Transboundary Water Management in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the consultancy is to:
1.	Lead the overall process in a consultative manner in order to identify project partner(s) and thematic and geographic focus area(s), formulate the project document, and assess potential Danish priorities/focus areas as part of the support to the TEI-TWM project.
2.	Develop draft and final programme document and all required annexes in a final format ultimately ready for discussion in the Danida Programme Committee, and subsequent approval by the Council for Development Policy and the Minister for Development Cooperation and Global Climate Policy, according to the Danida AMG for programmes above DKK 39 million.</narrative>
  </description>
